# anti-slop-pptx-kit v5.0 Active Rules

1. **Must Import Studio Templates**: Never write raw `addShape` loops or custom `triangle`/`trapezoid` illustrations. Import `templates/pptxgenjs-studio-kit.mjs`, `templates/python_pptx_studio.py`, or `templates/editorial-pdf-studio.html`.
2. **Zero Drop Shadows & Zero Vertical Accent Bars**: PowerPoint shapes must have shadows explicitly disabled; never paste vertical colored bars beside text blocks.
3. **Zero Uppercase Eyebrows & Zero Repeated Footers**: No `ALL CAPS EYEBROW` above titles and no repeated `Company · Deck · 3 / 10` footer banners.
4. **Word Budget & Separation**: 15–45 words per visible slide; put dense context into `speakerNotes`.
5. **PDF Support**: Use `editorial-pdf-design/SKILL.md` and `@page` print CSS for crisp A4/Letter/16:9 PDFs.
6. **Mandatory Gate**: Run `node scripts/audit-pptx-code.mjs .` (must exit `0`) before finishing.
